  "limitations": [
    "ICU stays are not healthy astronauts; there is no astronaut external validation.",
    "RecordID identifies an ICU stay, not a person; distinct stays from the same individual cannot be ruled out.",
    "Set A is split 80/20 for training/validation. Set B is a held-out source cohort, not external-hospital validation.",
    "Only past readings predict the next observed reading; irregular measurement timing and treatments can influence results.",
    "Only non-negative finite readings are retained; other outliers are retained. Duplicate variable/timestamp observations are averaged.",
    "Sleep uses a 60/20/20 respondent split. Survey weights/clustering are not used: these are unweighted research benchmarks, not US population estimates.",
    "Sleep values below 3 or above 14 are grouped codes and excluded. Predictors missing in Ridge are imputed from training only.",
    "No diagnosis labels, emergency protocol validation, treatment recommendations, or doctor comparison were evaluated.",
    "Mood, free-text symptoms and glucose fasting/device context do not have a validated model here.",
